## What to deliver

Build the seed-cache sprite up operation by operation until the image in
`canvas.png` matches the brief — a centered little heap of two or three rounded
golden seeds, outlined so they read apart, with a bright glint on top so the
cache looks valuable. When you are satisfied, stop: the recorded `actions.json`
is your finished submission.
